
# Workshop Completion

## Completion Summary

The Oracle hands-on workshop was completed successfully.

During the workshop, I gained practical experience working with Oracle Cloud and database technologies, including Oracle Autonomous Database, Database Actions, SQL, and Oracle Graph capabilities.

## Key Activities Completed

* Configured and accessed the Oracle workshop environment.
* Worked with Oracle Autonomous Database.
* Executed SQL queries using SQL Worksheet.
* Worked with the workshop dataset.
* Created and tested graph functionality.
* Executed graph queries and reviewed the results.
* Used graph visualization to explore data relationships.
* Troubleshot issues encountered during the hands-on exercises.
* Completed the required workshop activities.

## Evidence

Supporting screenshots and completion evidence are included in this folder where applicable.

The evidence demonstrates hands-on usage of Oracle technologies during the workshop.

